弟』といった関係にあたります。\n-構図に関しましては先生にお任せ致します。\n-もし笑顔を書かれる場合\nHO鰯（白っぽグレーの長髪の方です）は少し幼さが垣間見える性格です。HO柊（後述致します）の前ではにっこり笑います。\nHO柊（緑髪で黄色いメッシュがある方です）はうっすら笑う感じで、あまり顔で喜怒哀楽を表現するタイプではありません。兄貴肌です。どちらかと言えば『HO鰯が楽しそうで自分も嬉しい』フフっ　といった感じです。\n\n  何卒よろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1l5TCgRejoArORN7eLHJSU_yJ8VV-KCJV", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 899508, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "よしお", "screen_name": "scomsio", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar/media.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2F1643ff31-9fe7-49c5-a8d6-74e745d202d0.png%3Fsensitive%3Dtrue?avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/a2332b22-d895-43ee-8c7f-713a5d903a09.png", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": 76, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 3, "complete_expiration_days": 14, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 49}, {"id": 1318946, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "妙子", "screen_name": "t_a_eko", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2069047319442620416/asTL_Ttg.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1073976157001867264/1659299780/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 48}, {"id": 1597585, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "らくゆい＠にじそ通販", "screen_name": "_rakuyui_", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2062842755291009024/QTui1D1J.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1336661510873989128/1775727148/1500x5